    {
      "ConcreteType": "Dynamo.Graph.Nodes.CodeBlockNodeModel, DynamoCore",
      "NodeType": "CodeBlockNode",
      "Code": "// m3, from the same parameters that drive the geometry\nVwall = hs*(Ls*Ws - (Ls - 2*t)*(Ws - 2*t));\nVbase = Ls*Ws*t;\nVexc = Ls*Ws*hs;\nVcheck = walls.Volume/(k*k*k);\ntotals = [Math.Sum(Vwall), Math.Sum(Vbase), Math.Sum(Vexc)];\nnInst = 7*List.Count(runLen);",
      "Id": "27624019a98545348434c2cfeed9ebe7",
      "Inputs": [
